  "description": "Ring B multi-tenancy for the Goldpath enterprise asset: tenant resolution (header/subdomain, fail-closed), a global query filter on every IMultiTenant entity, automatic tenant stamping, and a cross-tenant write guard that treats violations as security events. Explicit Bypass()/Use() scopes for admin and background flows. Shared-db isolation; the messaging seam propagates tenants since Phase 1.",
